  "description": "The proposed use falls within the same Use Class (Class E) as the previous use of the premises. Although we understand that a formal change of use is not required, this application is being submitted to obtain a Lawful Development Certificate for peace of mind and to ensure clarity for all parties involved.\r\rThe proposal is to use the entire premises at The Chronicle Club, Ground and Basement Floor of 25 Furnival Street as a high-end, appointment-only personal training studio operated by Don Graham Fitness. The space will be used exclusively for one-to-one personal training sessions delivered by qualified fitness professionals. There will be no group training or classes. At full capacity, a maximum of approximately 25 clients will attend the premises each day. Equipment to be installed includes free weights, benches, and resistance machines ? no industrial or noisy machinery. Operating hours will be Monday to Friday, 6:30am to 7:30pm.",
